\end{equation*}



Combining this with  \eqref{eq:f_ell0_triangle} and \eqref{eq:f_tilde0_bound_stone}, we have that for any $\delta>0$, for $\alpha_\ell >\frac{1}{D}$, and for number of samples $n>N$ large enough, 
\[
